Hobbist is the app that will allow you to plan and track your hobbies and passions so that you never forget to do what you love. If you are tired of using — and losing — tons and tons of sheets of paper to write down your "To Be Read" lists, or of inexplicably forgetting how much you love Star Wars whenever a friend of yours asks you to suggest them a movie to watch... well, worry no more: Hobbist was born to solve your problems.

With Hobbist, you can:
-Write down in an organized way lists of the things that you want to enjoy or have enjoyed in the past (e.g. books to read, movies you watched, goals you want to achieve...);
-Enable the dark mode to rate the movie you just watched without permanently losing the ability to see;
-Schedule time for your hobbies and passions by using the "Agenda" feature, to make sure that you are able to take a break from every day's hustle;
-Synchronize the app with your calendar;
-Prioritize, rate, and take notes of whatever you decide to do to bring some fun and enjoyment to your days;
-Share your notes and lists with friends;
-Receive suggestions from the amazing developers and other users of this app.

